<title>POLAND: POLISH WHOLESALE WHEAT, BARLEY PRICES FALL.</title>
<headline>POLISH WHOLESALE WHEAT, BARLEY PRICES FALL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish wholesale prices of</p>
<p>wheat and barley and rye fell for the third week in a row, the</p>
<p>Agriculture Ministry said.</p>
<p>POLISH FARM AUCTION PRICES (AVERAGE)</p>
<p> Product    wk to Aug 26   pvs week   six-wk range yr/yr change</p>
<p> Wheat	 62 zl/q	  63 zl/q    62-67 zl/q	77 pct</p>
<p> Rye	   38 zl/q	  40 zl/q    38-44 zl/q	58 pct</p>
<p> Barley	53 zl/q	  54 zl/q    53-58 zl/q	71 pct</p>
<p>Source - The ministry's weekly report compiled by the Polish-</p>
<p>American market information and standardisation programme.</p>
<p>Zl/q = zloty per quintal. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
